Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository (code/,
audit/ scripts and patches, run_all.sh) and to the
outputs produced by that code.

Third-party data are NOT relicensed. The only third-party data files in this
repository are USGS ComCat files in data/raw/ (U.S. public domain). Data from
AFAD (Disaster and Emergency Management Authority, Türkiye), the International
Seismological Centre (ISC), the Nevada Geodetic Laboratory (NGL MIDAS), the
Global CMT Project and the GEM Global Active Faults database (CC BY-SA 4.0) are
not included; they are downloaded or obtained by the user and remain under the
terms of their providers (see README.md, "Data sources and terms").
